; (the seventh was added by review the same day, see PROMO_REPORT_NAME_DECIDED_AT):
;   1. the retired carousel's buttons already in chats answer with the rental menu and read no
;      table -- turbobaby/bot-surface, CAROUSEL_RETIRED_AT;
