; --- Surface 7: the names the promo sales report prints ------------------------------------------
; DECIDED 2026-09-25 by the operator, applying the owner's ruling of that day; added by review the
; same day. The label printed in place of a withheld name is admin-facing copy chosen then, and is
; cited here by name (REPORT_WITHHELD_NAME in src/trios/promo.rs), not quoted.

; WHY. promo_posts keeps every row the promoter ever wrote, and from 2026-08-19 until migration 083
; it also wrote about the product table 083 dropped: rows of the kind whose subject variant left
; with 083, and bestseller rows drawn from that table. The report printed each row's stored
; subject_name -- the old shop's product name -- to the owners in /promo (30 days) and on the admin
; route (up to 365 days). Whether production holds such a published row today was not read; the
; rule does not depend on the answer.

; THE RULE, fail closed (report_may_print_name). A stored name is printed only when a subject the
; promoter can build today writes the row's kind AND the link stored with the row opens the
; deep-link kind a live post of that kind opens. A row with no stored link (drafted before
; migration 076) is judged by its kind alone, except a bestseller: bestsellers were drawn from two
; tables until 083 and only the link tells which. Otherwise the name is withheld; the kind is kept
; when a live subject writes it and printed empty when none does, because that word is the retired
; one or one nobody here classified (the database forked from another shop's bot, DECISIONS.md D19).
; No row is hidden, so the report's post count and totals do not move, and nothing in the table is
; written.

; WHAT IT DOES NOT DECIDE. Whether a stored draft may still be SENT: that is the Publish button's
; question, and the same day's item-13 decision in turbobaby/promo-broadcast answers it there
; (publish_refusal in src/promo.rs, refusing every stored kind). This file claims no line of
; publish. Names of posts about the old shop's other tables -- accessories, teas, sets, events,
; which migration 085 hid rather than dropped -- are still printed: this surface withholds only a
; name the dropped table supplied, and PROMO_REPORT_OTHER_TABLES_NAMES_PRINTED keeps that visible.
pub const PROMO_REPORT_NAME_DECIDED_AT : str = "2026-09-25";
pub const PROMO_REPORT_NAME_DECIDED_BY : str = "operator, applying the owner's ruling of 2026-09-25 (answer 12)";
pub const PROMO_REPORT_NAME_SITE : str = "src/promo.rs report";
pub const PROMO_REPORT_NAME_DECISION : str = "src/trios/promo.rs report_kind_and_name";
pub const PROMO_REPORT_NAME_LABEL : str = "src/trios/promo.rs REPORT_WITHHELD_NAME";
pub const PROMO_REPORT_NAME_WIRING_TEST : str = "tests/promo_report_names_wiring.rs";
