; --- Cannabis-era copy the bundle still carried, retired 2026-09-26 ------------------------------
; A review of 405f30e found copy of the previous shop in the public bundle that no mounted screen
; printed. Every arm of src/trios/i18n.rs ships in the wasm whether a screen uses it or not: the
; committed dist/turbobaby-bot-f81e946a9d640a39_bg.wasm holds each of the phrases below once
; (grep -c -a -F, 2026-09-26). Under the owner's rulings of 2026-09-25 -- nothing cannabis-related
; anywhere (#12) and analyse all of it (answer 3) -- the operator had them retired on 2026-09-26.
; Nineteen keys were deleted outright: each declaration, each arm, and each of the thirteen rows
; the second parity gate's own list held, one-for-one by a comment line, so no line of that file
; moved. turbobaby/locale-policy owns the count (526 after it). What they were:
;   * the garden's bonus label, which no screen has printed since answer 3 relabelled a garden row
;     with the generic one (LEFTOVERS_2026_09_26_GARDEN_KEYS);
;   * the accessories screen's last two paraphernalia categories, storage and the lighter, with
;     their chips, emoji, colours and labels; ruling #12 had removed four of their siblings
;     (LEFTOVERS_2026_09_26_PARAPHERNALIA_KEYS);
;   * the strain card's lab-certificate link, printed by no screen since the cut-over of
;     2026-09-13 removed the lab results it sat beside (LEFTOVERS_2026_09_26_STRAIN_CARD_KEYS);
;   * the farm of the previous shop's shop game: plant, water and harvest, the plot states, the farm
;     tab and title, three log lines, the harvested counter and the random event whose herb half
;     ruling #12 had cut (LEFTOVERS_2026_09_26_FARM_KEYS). The game is unmounted since answer 7 and
;     stays compiled and exported, as that answer's paragraph above says; its farm zone, plots,
;     growth loop, event and star credit were removed from src/ui/game/shop_game.rs, and git keeps
;     them. No other screen used any of the nineteen.
; LEFT, EACH WITH ITS REASON. The ride game is answer 2's and was not touched. The accessories
; screen's clothing, souvenir and other categories, the shop game's cafe, grill and DJ copy, and
; the old menu's sort and badge labels are generic words that carry nothing cannabis-related. The
; tea model's fold list (src/trios/drink_categories.rs) still spells a CBD tea label: it is not in
; the bundle (its one reader is the unmounted tea screen, and the linker drops it: 0 hits in the
; same wasm), and it folds a stored label of that name into the generic tea category, so removing
; it would surface the word, not hide it (LEFTOVERS_2026_09_26_FOLD_WORD_IN_BUNDLE).
; No row, no migration, no sentence. tests/no_cannabis_client_wiring.rs keeps the nineteen keys and
; their copy out of the tables and out of every string literal under src/ui.
pub const LEFTOVERS_2026_09_26_AT : str = "2026-09-26";
