; still emits. Its price is a plain f64 (:27), so an absent price has no form, and effective_price
; (:38-50) maps a non-finite or negative total to 0.0: a confident zero where
; turbobaby/pricing-honesty's rate_present refuses every price that is not finite and strictly
; positive. Nobody sees it, because nothing mounts the card; it is recorded so that remounting the
; card is not mistaken for a clean surface. Its doc (:3) and the comment at :90-93 point at
; sets_screen.rs, which src/ui/screens no longer holds.
