; attaches a header (src/ui/api/http.rs:26 and :73), and a caller without admin proof is answered
; the missing-route 404 (src/api/quest.rs:67 and :261). So even remounted, these screens could show
; only their error banners. Three of their buttons open the kept quest -- the treasure hunt at :174
; and :228, the location quest at :197 -- the three navigations to it no customer can press.
pub const HUNT_SCREEN_READS : [4]str = [
